Title: The Long Way Home
Author: Test Writer

INT. KITCHEN - DAY

JANE stands at the counter, pouring coffee.

JANE
Morning.

JOHN (V.O.)
Is it though?

EXT. CITY STREET - DOWNTOWN - NIGHT

Rain falls hard. JANE runs across the wet asphalt, dodging traffic.

JANE (CONT'D)
Wait! Come back!

INT./EXT. CAR - MOVING - NIGHT

They drive in silence. The wipers beat time.
